---
import type { Lang } from "@i18n/ui";

type Props = {
  lang: Lang;
};

const { lang } = Astro.props;
---

{lang === "en" ? (
  <Fragment>
    <h4 class="animate font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
      Hi, I'm Simon <span class="text-xl">👋🏻</span>
    </h4>
    <article class="space-y-4">
      <p class="animate">
        I'm an AI forward deployed engineer at EXL in New York. Before that I studied
        data science at the University of Washington and information science at Cornell,
        and did two research internships at Central China Securities, the second one
        building factor models and backtests.
      </p>
      <p class="animate">
        My work sits where data engineering, machine learning, and quantitative finance
        meet. Outside of work I keep building things: LLM agents, data pipelines, and a
        personal trading system.
      </p>
      <p class="animate">
        This site is my working notebook. The blog holds longer write-ups — project
        retrospectives and things I have thought through. Notes are short records of
        what I learn along the way. It is mostly written for future me, but you are
        welcome to read along.
      </p>
    </article>
  </Fragment>
) : (
  <Fragment>
    <h4 class="animate font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">
      你好，我是 Simon <span class="text-xl">👋🏻</span>
    </h4>
    <article class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <!-- Keep each Chinese paragraph on one line: line breaks would render as spaces -->
      <p class="animate">我现在是 EXL 的 AI Forward Deployed Engineer，在纽约工作。此前我在华盛顿大学读数据科学，在康奈尔大学读信息科学硕士，还在中原证券做过两段研究实习，第二段负责搭建多因子模型和回测系统。</p>
      <p class="animate">我的工作处在数据工程、机器学习和量化金融的交汇处。工作之外我也一直在做自己的项目：LLM agent、数据流水线，还有一个个人量化交易系统。</p>
      <p class="animate">这个网站是我的工作笔记本。「博客」放较长的文章，比如项目复盘和想清楚了的事；「笔记」是学习路上的简短记录。它主要是写给未来的自己看的，也欢迎你一起读。</p>
    </article>
  </Fragment>
)}
